, saṁsāra bhitore","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"},"title":["Dainyātmikā"],"author":["Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["(prabhu he!)","emona durmati,    saṁsāra bhitore,","    poḍiyā āchinu āmi","tava nija-jana,    kono mahājane,","    pāṭhāiyā dile tumi"],"translation":["Mans netīrais prāts iemeta mani šajā pasaulē, ak, Kungs, taču viens no Taviem tīrajiem, īstenajiem bhaktām nāca, lai mani glābtu!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["doyā kori more,    patita dekhiyā,","    kohilo āmāre giyā","ohe dīna-jon,    śuno bhālo kathā","    ullasita ho’be hiyā"],"translation":["Ieraugot mani, tik kritušu un nožēlojamu, viņš apžēlojās par mani un pienāca pie manis sacīdams: “Nabaga dvēsele, uzklausi šo labo vēsti, tā iepriecinās tavu sirdi”."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["tomāre tārite,    śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya,","    nabadvīpe avatār","tomā heno koto,    dīna hīna jone,","    korilena bhava-pār"],"translation":["“Lai glābtu tevi, Šrī Krišna Čaitanja parādijās Navadvīpas zemē. Viņš palīdzēja daudzām tev līdzīgām nelaimīgām dvēselēm droši šķērsot materiālās esības bezdibeni.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["vedera pratijñā,    rākhibāra tore,","    rukma-varṇa vipra-suta","mahāprabhu nāme,    nadīyā mātāya,","    soṅge bhāi avadhūta"],"translation":["“Lai piepildītu Vēdās solīto, brahmana dēls vārdā Mahāprabhu, kura ķermenis laistās zeltā, atnāca kopā ar savu brāli avadhūtu Nitjānandu. Kopīgi viņi pārpludināja Nādiju ar dievišķo ekstāzi.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["nanda suta jini,    chaitanya gosāi,","    nija-nāma kori’ dāna","tārilo jagat,    tumi-o jāiyā,","    loho nija-paritrāṇa"],"translation":["“Šrī Čaitanja, pats Krišna, glāba šo pasauli, dāvājot tai savu Svēto Vārdu. Ej un iegūsti šo atbrīvi arī tu!”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["se kathā śuniyā,    āsiyāchi, nātha!","    tomāra charaṇa-tole","bhakativinoda,    kā̐diyā kā̐diyā,","    āpana-kāhinī bole"],"translation":["Ak, Kungs, dzirdot šos vārdus, Bhaktivinoda raud, lūdzas pēc Tavu lotosam līdzīgo pēdu dzīvinošās ēnas un stāsta savas dzīves stāstu."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda-7","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-emona-durmati","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-emona-durmati","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-emona","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-emona-1","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/acharya-maharaj-emona-durmati","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-emona-durmati","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/08-emana-durmati","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/emona-durmati","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-emona-durmati","personSlug":"caracas-temple"},{"title":"Sudarshan Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sudarshan-prabhu-dainyatmika","personSlug":"sudarshan-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph